 browser-visible 1024 px threshold is the Tailwind lg variant on the Menu button and nav."}, {"ref": "e2e/test_m6b_shell.py:233", "quote": "violations = _open_as(page, base_url, 1023, 800)", "claim": "The browser switch at 1023 and 1024 is checked by the separate menu scenario's test."}]}
