{"ts": "2026-11-19T14:14:28.492257Z", "run_id": "r-20261119T1403Z-ccf1", "unit": "openspec:add-app-shell", "seq": 28, "type": "delegate.result", "question": "Q-011", "id": "Q-011", "status": "answered", "reason": "Shell.tsx renders the sidebar grid from the tokens, the group markup and a single nav; nav-groups.ts orders the groups; the feature registry sorts by file name; the unit's e2e test asserts every row of the scenario. The generated test produced no head result, so there is no counter-signal to the code I read.", "called": true, "tasks": [], "target": "H-36707f19", "kind": "verdict", "batch": "Q-011+5", "batch_size": 5, "profile": "delegate-fable", "model": "claude-fable-5-1", "cli": "claude-code", "cost_usd": 0.72072, "decision": "accept", "answer_sha256": "719d132d102c695c066265f0bbf6e9a2cf07b0b716396e3ade30a46659c3fe5d", "checked": [{"ref": "web/src/app/Shell.tsx:94", "quote": "lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[var(--ui-sidebar-width)_minmax(0,1fr)]", "claim": "From 1024 px the signed-in shell is a grid whose first column is the sidebar width token."}, {"ref": "web/src/kit/tokens.css:40", "quote": "--ui-sidebar-width: 15rem;", "claim": "The sidebar column is 15rem, 240 px at the default root font size."}, {"ref": "web/src/kit/tokens.css:41", "quote": "--ui-banner-height: 3.5rem;", "claim": "The banner minimum height token is 3.5rem, 56 px."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/Shell.tsx:100", "quote": "min-h-(--ui-banner-height) flex-nowrap items-center", "claim": "The header is one non-wrapping row of at least the banner height."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/Shell.tsx:121", "quote": "<main id=\"main\" tabIndex={-1} className=\"min-w-0 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-2\">", "claim": "main sits in the second grid column, so it starts at x 240."}, {"ref": "web/src/app/nav-groups.ts:34", "quote": "const GROUP_ORDER: readonly NavGroupId[] = [\"home\", \"build\", \"admin\", \"more\"];", "claim": "Groups are emitted in the order home, build, admin, more."}, {"ref": "web/src/features/index.ts:6", "